// Distinct lens from the resume/behavioral modules: this groups the resume bullets into the
// actual PROJECTS behind them, and for each walks HOW it was built -> COMPLICATIONS that arise
// -> SOLUTIONS -> the interview follow-ups and answers. Written to be spoken out loud AND
// elaborative — flowing, detailed, first-person explanations that carry the full reasoning,
// not clipped bullet-fragments.
